{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0cf6fcabaa4b8edb","name":"Specialized Droid Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-0cf6fcabaa4b8edb","title":"Specialized Droid Talent Tree","revision":19579,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:13:33Z","sha256":"fe51676f7064f702ffe7062487dcb194b71e0891abf27de3625f38fc1664a3eb","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19579","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Specialized%20Droid%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0cf6fcabaa4b8edb","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have become more specialized than other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," of the same or a similar model.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Computer Language"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can use your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," modifier instead of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," modifier when making ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks. You are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," skill for the purpose of using this Talent. If you are entitled to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check reroll, you can reroll your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Computer Master"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can reroll any opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check, keeping the better of the two results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Enhanced Manipulation"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," 15\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have improved appendage manipulation routines. You can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," when making any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},"-based ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},", even if you are threatened or would not normally be able to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hotwired Processor"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You gain temporary processing power, enhancing your mental attributes. When you hotwire your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Processor"}," (a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},"), you gain a +5 circumstance bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"},"- and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"},"-based ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"},", and a +1 circumstance bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," rolls. A hotwiring lasts for a number of rounds equal to one-half your Heroic Level (rounded down). When the hotwiring ends, you move -1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". The penalties imposed by this condition persist until you receive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repairs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repairs"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Power Surge"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You temporarily surge your power systems to enhance your physical abilities. When you initiate a ",{"tag":"b","children":["Power Surge"]}," (a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},"), you gain a +1 circumstance bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," rolls, +1 die of damage on melee damage rolls, and an increase of 2 square to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},". A ",{"tag":"b","children":["Power Surge"]}," lasts for a number of rounds equal to one-half your Heroic Level (rounded down). When the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Power Surge"]}," ends, you move -1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". The penalties imposed by this condition persist until you receive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repairs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repairs"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Skill Conversion"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reprogram"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reprogram"}," yourself, you can sacrifice a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"}," for a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus","referenceId":"reference:453339c8a3cf4f4c"}," feat. You must meet the prerequisites for the feat (you must be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," you choose to gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus","referenceId":"reference:453339c8a3cf4f4c"}," for), and you can do this only once per ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reprogramming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reprogramming"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Power Boost"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Power Surge"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You channel your ",{"tag":"b","children":["Power Surge"]}," into a boost for your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Locomotion System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Locomotion_System"},". When you initiate a ",{"tag":"b","children":["Power Surge"]},", you can use one of the following bonuses with your installed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Locomotion System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Locomotion_System"},": \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jump"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jump","referenceId":"reference:9ee0ca3e24d60ea0"}," +4 squares (",{"tag":"a","children":["Walking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walking","referenceId":"reference:1dabd5131fa6e9e4"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wheeled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wheeled","referenceId":"reference:cd7bb26315f7b177"}," Locomotion), or"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Increase hovering height by 4 squares (",{"tag":"a","children":["Hovering"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hovering","referenceId":"reference:ae139bb21e607feb"}," Locomotion)."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can use this Talent for a number of rounds equal to one-half your Character Level (rounded down). At the end of a ",{"tag":"b","children":["Power Boost"]},", you move -1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," . The penalties imposed by this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," persist until you receive ",{"tag":"a","children":["Repairs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Repairs"},". You can use both ",{"tag":"b","children":["Power Surge"]}," and ",{"tag":"b","children":["Power Boost"]}," at the same time, but you must move -2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," steps on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
